    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Codebook\"\nsubtitle: \"Variable dictionary for the PDET municipality panel\"\ndate: last-modified\n---\n\n\n\n## Panel Overview\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nn_munis <- dplyr::n_distinct(panel$dane_code)\nn_years <- dplyr::n_distinct(panel$year)\nyr_range <- range(panel$year, na.rm = TRUE)\ndata_vars <- setdiff(names(panel), c(\"dane_code\", \"year\", \"muni_name\", \"dept_name\", \"subregion\"))\n\noverview <- tibble::tribble(\n  ~Metric,                ~Value,\n  \"Municipalities (PDET)\", as.character(n_munis),\n  \"Years\",                 sprintf(\"%d–%d (%d years)\", yr_range[1], yr_range[2], n_years),\n  \"Total rows\",            format(nrow(panel), big.mark = \",\"),\n  \"Data variables\",        as.character(length(data_vars)),\n  \"Sources\",               as.character(dplyr::n_distinct(comp$source))\n)\n\nknitr::kable(overview, col.names = c(\"\", \"\"), align = \"lr\")\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n\n|                      |                     |\n|:---------------------|--------------------:|\n|Municipalities (PDET) |                  170|\n|Years                 | 2000–2025 (26 years)|\n|Total rows            |                4,420|\n|Data variables        |                  156|\n|Sources               |                   17|\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Naming Convention\n\nAll variables follow the pattern: **`{Category}_{name}__{source}`**\n\n| Code | Category | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| `V` | Violence & Conflict | `V_massacre_cases__cnmh` |\n| `P` | Peacebuilding & Implementation | `P_impl_education__art` |\n| `J` | Justice & Dispute Resolution | `J_n_conciliadores__concil` |\n| `S` | Socioeconomic & Structural | `S_nbi__dnp` |\n| `G` | Geographic & Territorial | `G_nightlight__prio` |\n\n### Source Abbreviations\n\n| Abbrev | Full Name |\n|---|---|\n| `cnmh` | Centro Nacional de Memoria Histórica |\n| `ucdp` | Uppsala Conflict Data Program (GED v25.1) |\n| `jep` | JEP / VERDATA statistical homicide estimates |\n| `cerac` | CERAC False Positives dataset |\n| `daly` | Daly paramilitary-mayor pacts dataset |\n| `aponte` | Aponte González armed group control data |\n| `art` | Agencia de Renovación del Territorio (SIIPO, Pilar 1, Obras) |\n| `apc` | Agencia Presidencial de Cooperación Internacional |\n| `pdet` | PDET peace initiative counts |\n| `slj` | Sistemas Locales de Justicia |\n| `casjust` | Casas de Justicia |\n| `concil` | Conciliadores en Equidad / Solicitudes de Conciliación |\n| `urt` | Unidad de Restitución de Tierras |\n| `dnp` | Departamento Nacional de Planeación (Panel General + Fiscal) |\n| `igac` | IGAC (GINI municipal + Gestores Catastrales) |\n| `prio` | Peace Research Institute Oslo (PRIO-GRID) |\n| `ant` | Agencia Nacional de Tierras (Resguardos, Zonas Reserva, Consejos) |\n\n---\n\n## Full Variable Dictionary {.tabset}\n\n::: {.panel-tabset}\n\n### Searchable Table\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nif (nrow(comp) > 0) {\n  DT::datatable(\n    comp |>\n      dplyr::select(\n        Category    = category,\n        Source      = source,\n        Variable    = variable,\n        `N munis`   = n_munis_with_data,\n        `% coverage` = pct_munis\n      ) |>\n      dplyr::arrange(Category, Source, dplyr::desc(`% coverage`)),\n    rownames = FALSE,\n    filter   = \"top\",\n    escape   = FALSE,\n    options  = list(\n      pageLength = 40,\n      dom        = \"lfrtip\",\n      columnDefs = list(\n        list(targets = c(3, 4), className = \"dt-right\")\n      )\n    ),\n    caption = htmltools::tags$caption(\n      style = \"caption-side: top; text-align: left; font-size: 0.9em;\",\n      sprintf(\"Full codebook: %d variables, %d sources, %d categories\",\n              nrow(comp), dplyr::n_distinct(comp$source), dplyr::n_distinct(comp$category))\n    )\n  ) |>\n    DT::formatStyle(\n      \"% coverage\",\n      background = DT::styleColorBar(c(0, 100), \"#c6efce\"),\n      backgroundSize = \"98% 88%\",\n      backgroundRepeat = \"no-repeat\",\n      backgroundPosition = \"center\"\n    ) |>\n    DT::formatStyle(\n      \"% coverage\",\n      color = DT::styleInterval(c(1, 50, 90),\n                                 c(\"#b2182b\", \"#d6604d\", \"#555\", \"#1b7837\"))\n    ) |>\n    DT::formatStyle(\n      \"Category\",\n      color = DT::styleEqual(\n        c(\"Violence & Conflict\", \"Peacebuilding & Implementation\",\n          \"Justice & Dispute Resolution\", \"Socioeconomic & Structural\",\n          \"Geographic & Territorial\"),\n        c(\"#b2182b\", \"#1b7837\", \"#2166ac\", \"#8c510a\", \"#542788\")\n      ),\n      fontWeight = \"bold\"\n    )\n} else {\n  cat(\"> No data available. Run the pipeline first.\\n\")\n}\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"datatables html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-8ee5b89ff4be2c4bc439\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8ee5b89ff4be2c4bc439\">{\"x\":{\"filter\":\"top\",\"vertical\":false,\"filterHTML\":\"<tr>\\n  <td data-type=\\\"character\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: top;\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"form-group has-feedback\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: auto;\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"search\\\" placeholder=\\\"All\\\" class=\\\"form-control\\\" style=\\\"width: 100%;\\\"/>\\n      <span class=\\\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove-circle form-control-feedback\\\"><\\/span>\\n    <\\/div>\\n  <\\/td>\\n  <td data-type=\\\"character\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: top;\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"form-group has-feedback\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: auto;\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"search\\\" placeholder=\\\"All\\\" class=\\\"form-control\\\" style=\\\"width: 100%;\\\"/>\\n      <span class=\\\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove-circle form-control-feedback\\\"><\\/span>\\n    <\\/div>\\n  <\\/td>\\n  <td data-type=\\\"character\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: top;\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"form-group has-feedback\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: auto;\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"se